                "text": "Reject option-like references before invocation or use command-specific option terminators and safe object APIs. FP risk: Medium: custom validation and unsupported command wrappers need review; argv lists alone do not prevent option injection."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/BashaarJavaid/MCP-Sentinel/blob/main/docs/rules.md#sent-014",
              "id": "SENT-014",
              "name": "Command option injection",
              "properties": {
